sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Flutter as Flutter client
    participant Java as Spring Boot backend
    participant MySQL
    participant Python as Python AI service

    User->>Flutter: Sign in
    Flutter->>Java: POST /api/v1/auth with credentials
    Java->>MySQL: Verify identity and session state
    MySQL-->>Java: Authentication data
    Java-->>Flutter: Short-lived access token and renewable session

    User->>Flutter: Request recommendations or a meal plan
    Flutter->>Java: Authenticated, validated request plus request ID
    Java->>Java: Authenticate, authorize, and validate
    Java->>MySQL: Load profile, goals, recipes, nutrition, and pantry snapshot
    MySQL-->>Java: Authoritative domain snapshot
    Java->>Python: Typed AI request plus service identity and request ID
    Python->>Python: Filter, score, rank, or optimize with evidence

    alt AI computation succeeds
        Python-->>Java: Candidates, scores, explanations, and algorithm version
        Java->>Java: Validate IDs, bounds, and hard constraints
        Java-->>Flutter: Preview/result DTO
    else AI is unavailable, invalid, or times out
        Python--xJava: Bounded failure
        Java->>Java: Apply documented safe fallback or degraded error
        Java-->>Flutter: Degraded result or recoverable problem response
    end

    User->>Flutter: Accept a meal plan
    Flutter->>Java: Save selected result plus user edits
    Java->>MySQL: Revalidate current state and atomically persist accepted plan
    MySQL-->>Java: Saved plan and version
    Java-->>Flutter: Accepted plan DTO
